%! Part of an ontology: every motorbike has some motor as a part.
%!
%! This file is a module. A program uses it with `@use vehicles` and
%! reads the output `axiom`. The unnamed class is the blank node _:r. It
%! is local to this file, so it differs from a _:r in any other file.

axiom(motorbike, subClassOf, _:r) .
axiom(_:r, onProperty, hasPart) .
axiom(_:r, someValuesFrom, motor) .

@output axiom .
